    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think a counselor can fix this. its not just money. its the way i look at them and just feel like a failure. like im taking up space that could be used for someone who actually contributes. if i wasnt here, the money would go further, the stress would go down... it's just math at this point. it's like i'm just subtracting from their happiness every single day.",
