      "content": "but that's the thing, they're so happy when i'm not in the room. when i'm at work or just sitting in the dark, it's like the tension disappears. if i just stopped being a problem for them, they could finally breathe. it's like i'm the one holding all the bad air in the house. wouldn't it be more compassionate to just... let them have that peace?",
